### 查询 Amazon FBA 库存摘要
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/fba-inventory/summaries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "shopId": 1,
  "countryCode": "US",
  "details": true,
  "sellerSkus": ["SKU-001", "SKU-002"]
}

### 按变更时间分页查询 Amazon FBA 库存摘要
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/fba-inventory/summaries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "shopId": 1,
  "countryCode": "US"
}
